00:07:14.310 --> 00:07:15.280
Haruka.

00:07:15.280 --> 00:07:18.270
All of my friends suddenly deserted me

00:07:18.270 --> 00:07:22.500
once they found I liked anime and games.

00:07:22.500 --> 00:07:25.510
Even now it's painful and makes me feel sad.

00:07:25.510 --> 00:07:29.130
It's okay, you don't have to remember that any longer.

00:07:29.130 --> 00:07:30.800
B-But...

00:07:31.250 --> 00:07:34.450
before, I would have run away.

00:07:34.450 --> 00:07:37.010
Back before I met you.

00:07:38.780 --> 00:07:44.650
Since we met, I've gained the confidence to be proud of my hobbies.

00:07:44.650 --> 00:07:47.940
Now, no matter how much they avoid or mock me,

00:07:47.940 --> 00:07:50.820
I can proudly say that I love my hobbies.

00:07:50.820 --> 00:07:54.270
Thanks to you I've been able to change,

00:07:54.270 --> 00:07:56.700
I couldn't have done it on my own.

00:07:57.400 --> 00:07:58.590
Haruka.

00:07:59.240 --> 00:08:00.700
