00:09:17.220 --> 00:09:20.030
Haruka, are these okay like this?

00:09:20.030 --> 00:09:22.830
That's fine. Oh, but first...

00:09:23.150 --> 00:09:27.440
Umm, good afternoon. We're H&Y.

00:09:27.440 --> 00:09:29.960
Here's a copy of our work.

00:09:29.960 --> 00:09:32.920
Oh, thanks, I'm Igarashi Yuusaku.

00:09:34.000 --> 00:09:37.580
Wow! You did a novel.

00:09:37.580 --> 00:09:41.120
Yes, this is my first Comiket and I'm not very confident with my novel.

00:09:41.120 --> 00:09:44.640
I'm not sure how well it'll be received.

00:09:44.640 --> 00:09:48.510
Just ask us if there's anything you don't know.

00:09:48.510 --> 00:09:50.770
Let's work together today.

00:10:04.350 --> 00:10:07.270
Excuse me, are you H&Y?

00:10:07.270 --> 00:10:11.790
Y-Yes! Feel free to take a look at our work.

00:10:14.080 --> 00:10:15.010
You're from last time.

00:10:16.340 --> 00:10:19.050
So you did a game this Comiket?

00:10:19.050 --> 00:10:20.300
I'll take one.

00:10:21.000 --> 00:10:22.630
Thank you very much.

00:10:25.730 --> 00:10:28.370
We don't have to worry this time.

00:10:28.370 --> 00:10:30.710
Haruka-sama's getting used to it.

00:10:30.710 --> 00:10:35.100
We disguised ourselves so they won't spot us, but...

00:10:35.630 --> 00:10:37.530
We're really standing out.

00:10:37.530 --> 00:10:39.190
Yes, we are.

00:10:39.190 --> 00:10:41.190
Stealth mode failed.

00:10:43.620 --> 00:10:45.300
Yuuto!

00:10:45.300 --> 00:10:47.170
Oh, Nobunaga!

00:10:47.170 --> 00:10:48.750
You're doing great.

00:10:48.750 --> 00:10:51.540
Thanks, you really helped me out a lot.

00:10:51.540 --> 00:10:53.870
It's okay, no need to thank me.

00:10:53.870 --> 00:10:59.130
Oh right! Some people were looking for your circle, so I brought them with me.

00:10:59.130 --> 00:11:01.140
Really, our circle?

00:11:06.240 --> 00:11:07.990
Thank you very much.

00:11:07.990 --> 00:11:09.230
Haruka, I'm back.

00:11:09.550 --> 00:11:13.940
Yuuto-san, look! We sold another one!

00:11:13.940 --> 00:11:17.690
They came all the way out here to meet us.

00:11:17.690 --> 00:11:19.440
Isn't that great?

00:11:24.490 --> 00:11:25.620
Haruka?

00:11:32.650 --> 00:11:35.250
U-Umm... Haruka-chan.

00:11:35.800 --> 00:11:38.700
Haruka? Haruka!

00:11:38.700 --> 00:11:40.140
Haruka!

00:11:53.810 --> 00:11:54.770
Haruka?

00:11:58.650 --> 00:12:00.270
Onee-chan?

00:12:00.910 --> 00:12:02.070
Let's go!

00:12:04.530 --> 00:12:06.580
Excuse me! Show us more!

00:12:07.050 --> 00:12:09.040
Geez, leave us alone!

00:12:09.560 --> 00:12:11.210
I guess there's no other way.

00:12:12.870 --> 00:12:15.500
We're breaking through by force!

00:12:15.860 --> 00:12:19.710
Please refrain from taking pictures other than in designated cosplay areas.

00:12:19.710 --> 00:12:22.860
Also, sharp and dangerous objects are forbidden.

00:12:22.860 --> 00:12:25.610
Oh my. If you say so.

00:12:25.610 --> 00:12:27.180
We were thoughtless.

00:12:37.650 --> 00:12:41.950
It's disappointing Nogizaka-san has such an unrefined hobby.

00:12:41.950 --> 00:12:44.740
It's disgusting she's into anime at her age.

00:12:44.740 --> 00:12:46.320
Isn't she ashamed at all?

00:12:46.320 --> 00:12:48.280
U-Umm...

00:13:00.850 --> 00:13:02.320
Haruka!

00:13:03.230 --> 00:13:05.760
There you are, Haruka.

00:13:07.890 --> 00:13:09.220
Yuuto-san.

00:13:09.560 --> 00:13:11.810
Don't tell me those three are...

00:13:13.400 --> 00:13:18.610
They were my best friends at Seijukan Girls' Academy.

00:13:19.610 --> 00:13:23.130
We'd been in the same class since elementary school,

00:13:23.130 --> 00:13:25.400
and were always together.

00:13:25.400 --> 00:13:27.150
Even after what happened,

00:13:27.150 --> 00:13:30.800
I still thought of them as friends once I entered high school.

00:13:30.800 --> 00:13:31.410
But...

00:13:37.130 --> 00:13:41.630
But why did they come to see you here now?

00:13:41.630 --> 00:13:43.340
I don't know.

00:13:43.340 --> 00:13:48.250
I haven't spoken to them since that day.

00:13:48.260 --> 00:13:52.010
Also, I don't know what to say to them.

00:13:52.010 --> 00:13:55.970
I can't have fun with them like I did in the past.

00:14:10.850 --> 00:14:13.280
I won't be able to solve this for you.

00:14:13.280 --> 00:14:16.870
This is something you have to resolve on your own.

00:14:18.290 --> 00:14:22.610
While I can't help directly, I can still cheer you on.

00:14:26.820 --> 00:14:32.300
I believe in you Haruka, and you should believe in yourself.

00:14:32.300 --> 00:14:33.430
In myself?

00:14:33.880 --> 00:14:36.490
Yeah, good luck Haruka.

00:14:41.540 --> 00:14:43.190
Yuuto-san,

00:14:43.190 --> 00:14:45.700
I'm really scared.

00:14:45.700 --> 00:14:48.410
I've always been scared that if I talked to them,

00:14:48.410 --> 00:14:51.800
I would lose everything.

00:14:51.800 --> 00:14:55.410
But truthfully I want to talk about it.

00:14:59.880 --> 00:15:03.500
Let's go now... to where they are.

00:15:03.500 --> 00:15:06.300
In order to resolve my past.

00:15:06.970 --> 00:15:09.950
In order to move forward with you.

00:15:13.750 --> 00:15:19.410
Sure, we were a bit shocked when we learned about your hobby,

00:15:19.410 --> 00:15:21.760
but only at first.

00:15:22.510 --> 00:15:27.000
No matter what hobbies you have, you're still Haruka-chan.

00:15:27.000 --> 00:15:28.740
So why then?

00:15:29.180 --> 00:15:33.700
She threatened us, and we were told to alienate you.

00:15:33.700 --> 00:15:37.160
What did you say? Who did that?

00:15:39.470 --> 00:15:42.170
Tennouji Setsugetsuka.

00:15:43.120 --> 00:15:44.840
I know that name...

00:15:44.840 --> 00:15:49.310
Tennouji-san, hailed as the "Empress of Seijukan,"

00:15:49.310 --> 00:15:52.150
is rumored to consider Haruka-chan her enemy.

00:15:52.150 --> 00:15:55.090
So when Haruka-chan's hobby was exposed,

00:15:55.090 --> 00:16:01.060
she threatened the entire class– no, the entire school to isolate you.

00:16:01.060 --> 00:16:05.270
DIE CREEPY OTAKU!
Others, under her orders, did a lot of horrible things to you.

00:16:05.650 --> 00:16:07.980
We never wanted to follow her orders,

00:16:07.980 --> 00:16:12.530
but were afraid of what would happen if we defied her.

00:16:12.920 --> 00:16:18.410
It may be too late, but we wanted to apologize to you, Haruka-chan.

00:16:18.410 --> 00:16:20.220
Despite the threats,

00:16:20.220 --> 00:16:25.460
we can't bear to continue shunning Haruka-chan.

00:16:25.460 --> 00:16:29.820
We can't ask you to forgive us, but we need to apologize properly.

00:16:29.820 --> 00:16:31.720
We're so sorry.

00:16:31.720 --> 00:16:36.630
A single word... even a single world would have made me happy.

00:16:36.630 --> 00:16:40.180
Why couldn't you say it back then?

00:16:43.220 --> 00:16:47.260
That fact alone troubles me... saddens me...

00:16:48.860 --> 00:16:50.520
Haruka-chan.

00:16:50.520 --> 00:16:53.010
We're sorry. We're sorry.

00:16:53.010 --> 00:17:01.020
But... But because of that, I found something irreplaceable.

00:17:03.770 --> 00:17:06.830
The wonderful people at Hakujou Academy,

00:17:06.830 --> 00:17:10.730
and then... more than anything else...

00:17:10.730 --> 00:17:13.440
I was able to meet Yuuto-san.

00:17:14.300 --> 00:17:18.010
And for me, that is more precious than anything.

00:17:24.570 --> 00:17:25.690
That's why...

00:17:28.170 --> 00:17:29.640
That's why I...

00:17:30.590 --> 00:17:32.860
forgive you.

00:17:39.280 --> 00:17:41.750
We're sorry! We're sorry!

00:17:41.750 --> 00:17:44.270
Please forgive me too.

00:17:44.270 --> 00:17:47.840
I didn't have faith in you.

00:17:47.840 --> 00:17:50.340
No, you've done nothing wrong!

00:17:50.340 --> 00:17:53.230
Everything was our fault.

00:17:53.230 --> 00:17:55.840
We're sorry... and thank you.

00:18:00.010 --> 00:18:01.950
Good for you, Onee-chan.

00:18:01.950 --> 00:18:03.570
It's a peaceful resolution.

00:18:03.570 --> 00:18:05.480
I, I, I!

00:18:08.840 --> 00:18:12.480
You know, we have one other thing to apologize about.

00:18:12.480 --> 00:18:13.110
Huh?

00:18:19.250 --> 00:18:21.090
Th-These are...

00:18:34.570 --> 00:18:35.880
It's like a dream.

00:18:36.480 --> 00:18:38.470
Our game sold out.

00:18:38.470 --> 00:18:42.930
Yeah, with Nobunaga's advertising, we got a long line.

00:18:44.210 --> 00:18:46.780
Seems like we should thank Asakura-san.

00:18:46.780 --> 00:18:47.390
Yeah.

00:18:53.780 --> 00:18:56.820
I love anime!

00:18:57.500 --> 00:18:59.530
Ha-Haruka?

00:18:59.530 --> 00:19:02.650
I love games!

00:19:02.650 --> 00:19:05.010
I also love manga!

00:19:05.010 --> 00:19:08.160
I love Noto Mamiko-san too!

00:19:08.160 --> 00:19:08.830
And then...

00:19:11.470 --> 00:19:12.900
Umm...

00:19:12.900 --> 00:19:19.300
I lo-lo-love...

00:19:19.300 --> 00:19:20.970
Yuuto-san!

00:19:39.760 --> 00:19:44.820
I love you too, Haruka! I really do!

00:19:45.550 --> 00:19:47.270
Yuuto-san.

00:19:50.130 --> 00:19:50.790
Haruka!

00:19:54.930 --> 00:19:56.170
Are you okay?

00:19:56.170 --> 00:19:58.020
Y-Yes.

00:19:58.020 --> 00:19:59.460
I'm happy.

00:20:02.090 --> 00:20:03.250
Haruka.

00:20:03.250 --> 00:20:04.650
Yuuto-san.

00:20:10.640 --> 00:20:14.450
Kyaa! All lovey-dovey in public.

00:20:14.450 --> 00:20:16.080
How intense.

00:20:16.080 --> 00:20:17.610
So intense.

00:20:30.350 --> 00:20:31.370
Yuuto-san.

00:20:33.300 --> 00:20:34.240
I love you too, Haruka! I really do!

00:20:34.240 --> 00:20:36.460
What the hell's up with my ringtone?
I love you too, Haruka! I really do!

00:20:36.460 --> 00:20:37.040
I love you too, Haruka! I really do!

00:20:37.040 --> 00:20:39.730
Mika, when did you change my ringtone?

00:20:39.730 --> 00:20:41.730
Onii-san, we've got trouble!

00:20:41.730 --> 00:20:44.380
My cellphone's in trouble too!

00:20:44.380 --> 00:20:46.260
Onee-chan is missing!

00:20:46.720 --> 00:20:47.720
Huh?

00:20:47.720 --> 00:20:52.280
Even though she returned to her room earlier, now she's vanished.

00:20:52.280 --> 00:20:54.890
We've searched the compound, but she's nowhere to be found.

00:20:54.900 --> 00:20:56.290
Haruka.

00:20:58.280 --> 00:20:59.500
I love you too, Haruka–

00:20:59.500 --> 00:21:01.870
Hello. Sorry, but I'm in a hurry.

00:21:01.870 --> 00:21:03.820
Good evening, Yuuto-san.

00:21:03.820 --> 00:21:05.490
Oh! Akiho-san.

00:21:05.490 --> 00:21:07.040
It's been a while.

00:21:07.040 --> 00:21:08.860
But first, Haruka's–

00:21:08.860 --> 00:21:11.030
She's fine.

00:21:11.030 --> 00:21:13.160
I am quite aware of her whereabouts.

00:21:13.160 --> 00:21:14.030
Huh?

00:21:14.030 --> 00:21:15.620
What is this all about?

00:21:15.620 --> 00:21:18.360
I shall stop beating around the bush.

00:21:18.990 --> 00:21:21.840
Haruka is going to be married.

00:21:21.840 --> 00:21:25.290
What? Haruka's getting married?

00:21:25.290 --> 00:21:29.780
I'm quite grateful to you for being friends with Haruka until now.

00:21:29.780 --> 00:21:35.270
Despite that, I would like you to forget about Haruka.

00:21:35.270 --> 00:21:39.050
Pl-Please wait! I don't understand.

00:21:39.050 --> 00:21:41.830
Yuuto-san, I'm going to be frank with you.

00:21:41.830 --> 00:21:45.240
What can you do for Haruka?

00:21:45.240 --> 00:21:47.860
We know how you feel about her.

00:21:47.860 --> 00:21:52.570
But we are aiming to insure that girl's future.

00:21:52.570 --> 00:21:54.380
It's necessary for her sake.

00:21:54.380 --> 00:21:56.220
Now, regarding our discussion,

00:21:56.220 --> 00:22:01.540
will you be able to provide her the life she deserves?

00:22:01.540 --> 00:22:03.760
That... I...

00:22:04.100 --> 00:22:07.060
Haruka is a member of the Nogizaka household

00:22:07.060 --> 00:22:12.400
and I cannot allow her to be seen living a life below her station.

00:22:12.400 --> 00:22:18.480
Can you protect Haruka when you don't have the power to do so?

00:22:19.900 --> 00:22:21.520
I...

00:22:22.680 --> 00:22:23.820
I...

00:22:24.800 --> 00:22:26.920
You're unable to give a reply?

00:22:26.920 --> 00:22:30.280
I see. You're speechless.

00:22:31.150 --> 00:22:32.450
I...

00:22:32.450 --> 00:22:34.080
Farewell, Yuuto-san.

00:22:34.080 --> 00:22:36.140
Akiho-san, I–

00:23:02.280 --> 00:23:04.670
It won't just end with this

00:23:04.670 --> 00:23:11.720
At this rate, we'll have heart-fluttering repeats

00:23:11.720 --> 00:23:14.210
With our goodbye technique...

00:23:14.210 --> 00:23:19.920
At this rate, we'll be heroines

00:23:19.920 --> 00:23:22.280
Gently, see you later

00:23:22.280 --> 00:23:24.750
See you later, idiot!

00:23:24.750 --> 00:23:28.780
It may be the end, but I still want to stay in touch

00:23:28.780 --> 00:23:29.950
I'm sorry

00:23:29.950 --> 00:23:34.360
We carefully utter the forbidden truth

00:23:34.360 --> 00:23:37.290
Properly, consecutively, tightly, reasonably, certainly,

00:23:37.290 --> 00:23:39.650
give me a love rhythm!

00:23:39.650 --> 00:23:42.000
I want to see you take responsibility!

00:23:42.000 --> 00:23:46.130
I won't let it end like this

00:23:46.130 --> 00:23:50.660
That unknown letter definitely contains the words "I love you"

00:23:50.660 --> 00:23:55.540
Saying goodbye isn't allowed

00:23:55.540 --> 00:24:00.230
From my heart and my lips I say thanks

00:24:00.230 --> 00:24:03.160
As a girl I am happy,

00:24:03.160 --> 00:24:05.520
despite these tears I am happy

00:24:05.520 --> 00:24:10.090
Now, smile and wipe your tears

00:24:10.090 --> 00:24:15.010
while executing this great farewell plan!

